  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">오늘은 온실효과에 대해서 실험해봅니다!<br>일단, 대기가 있고 대기에 온실 기체가 많으면<br>복사 에너지가 지구 외부로 빠져나가지 못하고<br>일부가 다시 지구로 돌아오면서 <br>지구 온도가 높게 유지가 되는건데요</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb0a64334e20eb9aa9e7c120c84fa20e8f4891d8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fb0a64334e20eb9aa9e7c120c84fa20e8f4891d8\" data-origin-width=\"834\" data-origin-height=\"677\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b2233b8454343421da2f3cb67584792f7023a135\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b2233b8454343421da2f3cb67584792f7023a135\" data-origin-width=\"1021\" data-origin-height=\"1473\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">드라이 아이스와 랩(각각 역할은 온실기체와 두꺼운 대기층 정도겠죠?)을 적용한 곳과 아닌 곳을 각각<br>대조군으로 설정하여 실험하면 됩니다!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c982bb7c6c0864c6c8c5dcb9b0493f78db8022da\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c982bb7c6c0864c6c8c5dcb9b0493f78db8022da\" data-origin-width=\"1025\" data-origin-height=\"1476\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e081a5190f94fde29f8be62aa4043612723f9e7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1e081a5190f94fde29f8be62aa4043612723f9e7\" data-origin-width=\"1033\" data-origin-height=\"1495\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<a href=\"\nhttps://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"></